# 🗄️ FORENSEQUENCE
**AI-Based Digital Forensic Investigation & Real-Time Report Assistant**

[![Python 3.10+](https://img.shields.io/badge/python-3.10+-0B0F2B.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=python&logoColor=00F0FF)](https://www.python.org/)
