> *"A desktop digital forensic assistant that extracts facts from multiple evidence sources, uses a Rule-Based Expert System with Forward Chaining to derive forensic findings in real time as new evidence appears, reconstructs the sequence of events, calculates a risk level, and generates an explainable forensic investigation report."*

</div>

---

## 🔍 System Architecture

FORENSEQUENCE does not rely on Machine Learning or external APIs. It is a deterministic, **Knowledge-Based Expert System** utilizing **Propositional Logic** and **Forward Chaining** to guarantee explainable, reproducible forensic findings.

| Module | Core Functionality |
| :--- | :--- |
| **01. Case Management** | Multi-case tracking with SHA-256 evidence hashing for chain-of-custody integrity. |
| **02. Evidence Analyzers** | Modular fact extraction from System Logs, File/Folder metadata, Browser History, and Emails. |
| **03. AI Rule Engine** | Forward Chaining inference engine executing a custom forensic Knowledge Base (`rules.py`). |
| **04. Risk & Timeline** | Weighted risk scoring (0–100 scale) and chronological event reconstruction. |
| **05. Real-Time Monitor** | **Flagship Feature:** Live monitoring of evidence files with instant auto-reasoning and UI alerts. |
| **06. Forensic Reports** | Automated generation of in-app and exportable PDF investigation reports. |

---

## 🎨 UI/UX: "Neon Forensics"
The application features a custom, frameless desktop interface built on Tkinter, styled with a **Cyberpunk Glassmorphism** aesthetic. 
* **Base:** Deep Void (`#0B0F2B`) & Abyss (`#042142`)
* **Accents:** Vice Cyan (`#00F0FF`) & Sunset Pink (`#FF5CA8`)
* **Visuals:** Translucent glass panels, vector-drawn iconography, and smooth 60FPS UI rendering without blocking the background processing threads.

---

## 👥 The Investigation Team

This project is built collaboratively, dividing the architecture between frontend/systems and AI/analytics.

* **Salman** (Initial Architecture & Systems)
  * UI/UX Engineering & Glassmorphism Implementation
  * Evidence Parsers, Case Management & SQLite DB
  * Live Monitoring Threading (`watchdog` + Queues)
* **Kavya** (AI Reasoning & Analytics)
  * Knowledge Base Engineering (`rules.py`)
  * Forward Chaining Algorithm (`rule_engine.py`)
  * Risk Scoring, Timeline Reconstruction & PDF Reporting

